/-!
# The early local theorem and its marked center application

This family proves 12.8.4(1--4) from the earlier setup consequences, including
the exact kernel of the local tilde representation. In the nonabelian H=G₁
branch it constructs Φ(U)=V₁, the commutator/square bounds and the marked
symplectic form, then applies the completed center calculation to obtain the
conditional internal-product and centralization clause of 12.8.10(5).

The original setup inputs and the remaining 12.8.4--8 source clauses retain
their Section08 assembly owners. Source: Aschbacher--Smith, printed pp.850--854.
-/
